title: ZYKO — Universal AI Orchestration Platform
message: >-
  If you use ZYKO in your research or production systems, please cite it
  using this metadata.
type: software
authors:
  - name: ZYKO Contributors
    website: "https://github.com/tibatechapp-ship-it/zyko"
version: 0.4.0
date-released: 2026-11-01
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/tibatechapp-ship-it/zyko"
abstract: >-
  ZYKO is a pure-Python, cross-platform AI orchestration platform with
  verifiable multi-provider routing (routing receipts), Policy-as-Code
  governance, reproducible quality benchmarks, and MCP-native agents.
  It runs on Linux, Windows, macOS, Android and Termux.
keywords:
  - llm
  - routing
  - orchestration
  - agents
  - mcp
  - model-context-protocol
  - policy-as-code
  - termux
  - android
